# ==============================================================================
# Git Ignore Rules for Command Code Go Plugin (CLIProxyAPI)
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. 编译生成物与动态链接库 (Build Artifacts & Shared Libraries)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Go c-shared 编译输出的动态库和导出的 C 头文件 (严禁提交，超 15MB 且具有平台特定性)
*.so
*.so.*
*.dylib
*.dll
*.a
*.o
*.exe
commandcode-go.so
commandcode-go.so.*
commandcode-go.h

# 编译与依赖维护日志
*.log
build.log
tidy.log
nohup.out

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. 凭据、私有配置与本地认证文件 (Credentials & Local Configs)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CPA 认证存储与账户凭据（由管理后台自动生成的认证文件）
cmdc-*.json
auth/
.cli-proxy-api/

# 本地运行时配置文件（仅保留模板 config.example.yaml）
config.yaml
config*.yaml
!config.example.yaml

# 环境变量与私钥证书
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
*.pem
*.crt
*.cert

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. 本地临时测试脚本与测试输出 (Test Scripts & Temporary Data)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 调试脚本与临时用例（防止生产环境测试脚本外溢）
test_*.py
test_*.sh
test_*.go
*.test
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# 临时目录
tmp/
temp/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. 编辑器与操作系统杂质 (IDE & OS Specifics)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# JetBrains / VSCode / Sublime
.idea/
.vscode/
*.code-workspace
*.sublime-project
*.sublime-workspace
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# 操作系统缓存文件
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
